.TH FCHMOD 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
fchmod \- change permissions of an open file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/stat.h>
.B int fchmod(int descriptor, mode_t mode);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Changes permissions of the file referred to by descriptor to Linux mode bits.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set. Success leaves errno unchanged.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR chmod (3crunch),
.BR fchmod (2)
